{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前在蘇州出席時尚活動的「滑雪女神」谷愛凌，前日在社交網透露已抵達北京，並說：「昨日的秋，今日的冬。</p><p>」她分享身穿淺綠色無袖旗袍的靚相，裙身有飛燕花紋，正好呼應其母親「谷燕」的名字，難怪她一看到便喜歡。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24.553597+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:11.114435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:11.114435+00:00","content_hash":"0ffe0310765dfa84dbfc9e69b9b8009927b8ab939d33787f7cc2f2322005040b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}